<title>USA: TENNIS-RESULTS FROM WORLD DOUBLES CHAMPIONSHIP.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-RESULTS FROM WORLD DOUBLES CHAMPIONSHIP.</headline>
<dateline>HARTFORD, Connecticut 1996-11-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the</p>
<p>round-robin Phoenix/ATP Tour World Doubles Championship</p>
<p>Saturday:</p>
<p>Round robin, semifinals:</p>
<p>Mark Woodforde and Todd Woodbridge (Australia) beat Grant</p>
<p>Connell (Canada) and Byron Black (Zimbabwe) 6-3 6-3</p>
<p>Alex O'Brien (U.S.) and Sebastien Lareau (Canada) beat</p>
<p>Trevor Kronemann (U.S.) and David Macpherson (Australia) 7-6</p>
<p>(10- 8) 7-6 (7-4)</p>
</text>
